{"id":"durable-interrupt","lesson_id":"agent-application-orchestration-04","context_id":"concept-durable-interrupt","question":"人工审批为什么是持久化状态而不是等待线程？","aliases":["Agent能一直阻塞等人批准吗"],"keywords":["人工审批","持久化状态","等待线程","Agent"],"diagnostic":"检查waiting_approval和lease释放。","hints":["查看 #concept-durable-interrupt。","进程可以退出。"],"example":"run waiting_approval。","answer":"人工响应可能很久；应提交状态和checkpoint、释放资源，稍后按run ID恢复。","source":{"label":"持久化中断","href":"#concept-durable-interrupt"},"updated_at":"2026-07-31","recommended":true},
{"id":"approval-transaction","lesson_id":"agent-application-orchestration-04","context_id":"concept-durable-interrupt","question":"创建审批请求时哪些数据要同事务提交？","aliases":["approval和run状态能分开写吗"],"keywords":["创建审批","事务","approval","run状态"],"diagnostic":"检查请求与waiting状态一致性。","hints":["查看 #concept-durable-interrupt。","防止孤儿审批。"],"example":"insert approval + update run。","answer":"审批记录和run切换到waiting_approval必须同事务提交，并释放lease。","source":{"label":"持久化中断","href":"#concept-durable-interrupt"},"updated_at":"2026-07-31","recommended":true},
{"id":"three-decisions","lesson_id":"agent-application-orchestration-04","context_id":"concept-approval-decisions","question":"approve、edit、reject 分别表示什么？","aliases":["人工审批的三种决定有什么区别"],"keywords":["approve","edit","reject","人工审批"],"diagnostic":"检查proposed与decided payload。","hints":["查看 #concept-approval-decisions。","reject不可恢复。"],"example":"edit保存替代参数。","answer":"approve接受提议，edit用审批人确认的新参数替代，reject终止且不可恢复。","source":{"label":"审批决定","href":"#concept-approval-decisions"},"updated_at":"2026-07-31","recommended":true},
{"id":"approval-isolation","lesson_id":"agent-application-orchestration-04","context_id":"concept-approval-decisions","question":"他人访问审批请求应该返回什么？","aliases":["跨主体approval如何隐藏"],"keywords":["他人","审批请求","跨主体","approval"],"diagnostic":"检查owner过滤和资源存在性。","hints":["查看 #concept-approval-decisions。","统一不可见。"],"example":"approval_not_visible。","answer":"按owner前置过滤并返回404式不可见，不能泄露请求存在或内容。","source":{"label":"审批决定","href":"#concept-approval-decisions"},"updated_at":"2026-07-31","recommended":true},
{"id":"lease-purpose","lesson_id":"agent-application-orchestration-04","context_id":"example-lease-checkpoint-effect","question":"长任务 lease 解决什么问题？","aliases":["为什么两个worker不能同时推进run"],"keywords":["长任务","lease","worker","run"],"diagnostic":"检查单活worker和到期接管。","hints":["查看 #example-lease-checkpoint-effect。","lease会过期。"],"example":"worker-a持有30秒。","answer":"它保证同一时刻只有一个worker推进run，同时允许worker崩溃后由他人到期接管。","source":{"label":"lease检查点副作用","href":"#example-lease-checkpoint-effect"},"updated_at":"2026-07-31","recommended":true},
{"id":"atomic-checkpoint","lesson_id":"agent-application-orchestration-04","context_id":"example-lease-checkpoint-effect","question":"checkpoint 为什么要与完成 step 原子提交？","aliases":["步骤完成和游标能分开保存吗"],"keywords":["checkpoint","完成step","原子提交","游标"],"diagnostic":"检查崩溃窗口。","hints":["查看 #example-lease-checkpoint-effect。","两个事实必须一致。"],"example":"run_steps+checkpoint transaction。","answer":"分开写会出现步骤已完成但游标未前进或相反，恢复时导致重复或跳步。","source":{"label":"lease检查点副作用","href":"#example-lease-checkpoint-effect"},"updated_at":"2026-07-31","recommended":true},
{"id":"effect-idempotency","lesson_id":"agent-application-orchestration-04","context_id":"example-lease-checkpoint-effect","question":"副作用幂等键怎样用于崩溃恢复？","aliases":["重放publish怎样避免重复"],"keywords":["副作用","幂等键","崩溃恢复","publish"],"diagnostic":"检查稳定effect key和receipt。","hints":["查看 #example-lease-checkpoint-effect。","返回首次结果。"],"example":"publish:lesson:1。","answer":"为同一业务动作使用稳定key；首次保存receipt，重放同key返回首次结果而不重复执行。","source":{"label":"lease检查点副作用","href":"#example-lease-checkpoint-effect"},"updated_at":"2026-07-31","recommended":true},
{"id":"approval-expiry","lesson_id":"agent-application-orchestration-04","context_id":"modify-add-approval-expiry","question":"审批过期后为什么要创建新请求？","aliases":["能复用过期approval ID吗"],"keywords":["审批过期","新请求","approval ID"],"diagnostic":"检查历史不可变和新上下文。","hints":["查看 #modify-add-approval-expiry。","旧决定窗口已结束。"],"example":"new approval ID。","answer":"旧提议和期限是不可变审计事实；重新提议应带新ID和新的有效期。","source":{"label":"增加审批过期","href":"#modify-add-approval-expiry"},"updated_at":"2026-07-31","recommended":true},
{"id":"duplicate-effect","lesson_id":"agent-application-orchestration-04","context_id":"troubleshoot-approval-recovery","question":"崩溃恢复后重复发送先查什么？","aliases":["Agent副作用重复怎么排查"],"keywords":["崩溃恢复","重复发送","Agent副作用","排查"],"diagnostic":"检查effect key语义与receipt。","hints":["查看 #troubleshoot-approval-recovery。","key必须跨重试稳定。"],"example":"send:user:message-id。","answer":"检查业务级effect key是否稳定、首次receipt是否在重放前查询，以及外部服务是否支持幂等。","source":{"label":"审批恢复排错","href":"#troubleshoot-approval-recovery"},"updated_at":"2026-07-31","recommended":true},
{"id":"exactly-once-boundary","lesson_id":"agent-application-orchestration-04","context_id":"deepen-exactly-once-boundary","question":"数据库唯一 receipt 能证明端到端 exactly-once 吗？","aliases":["单库幂等等于外部调用只一次吗"],"keywords":["数据库","唯一receipt","exactly-once","外部调用"],"diagnostic":"检查数据库与外部系统提交窗口。","hints":["查看 #deepen-exactly-once-boundary。","需要outbox或补偿。"],"example":"DB commit和API call不原子。","answer":"不能；数据库与外部服务之间仍有崩溃窗口，需要外部幂等、outbox、查询或补偿。","source":{"label":"端到端幂等边界","href":"#deepen-exactly-once-boundary"},"updated_at":"2026-07-31","recommended":true},
{"id":"postgres-evidence","lesson_id":"agent-application-orchestration-04","context_id":"project-learning-assistant-v34","question":"v0.34 为什么必须用真实 PostgreSQL 测试？","aliases":["Mock能证明lease和事务吗"],"keywords":["v0.34","真实PostgreSQL","Mock","lease","事务"],"diagnostic":"检查行锁、事务和唯一约束。","hints":["查看 #project-learning-assistant-v34。","mock:false。"],"example":"8项容器测试。","answer":"lease竞争、事务原子性和唯一约束属于真实数据库行为，Mock不能作为等价证据。","source":{"label":"智能学习助手v0.34","href":"#project-learning-assistant-v34"},"updated_at":"2026-07-31","recommended":false},
